{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "articleId": "ad136e854f03",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-29T13:00:00Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/adaptive-ai-waf-testing/",
  "sourceTitle": "We tested our own WAF with frontier AI models. Here’s what we found",
  "sourceBodyHash": "79430d43b400e693a1a78d8228977db4409f1c7aa85697081a7b5fa745e3b166",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-29T22:40:16.439140Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-30T01:04:06.926314Z",
  "totalBlocks": 65,
  "translatedBlocks": 64,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "507df67fc38b8d37",
      "translationZh": "“您的WAF准备好应对前沿AI模型了吗？”我们不断收到客户的这个提问，于是决定深入了解。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d52ae5a2f6fd2a9f",
      "translationZh": "在利用应用程序时，LLM 真正擅长的是以比任何人类黑客更快的速度迭代和变异攻击载荷。LLM 可以利用实时响应来迭代并改变其技术，例如测试不同的编码方式、将载荷发送到 HTTP 请求的不同位置，或转向下一个漏洞进行测试。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f71cfc14bbcb3d",
      "translationZh": "即使在大型语言模型出现之前，安全工程师也使用两种常见方法来测试应用程序：静态应用安全测试和动态应用安全测试。前者在不执行代码的情况下分析代码，以识别漏洞；后者则对运行中的应用程序进行探测，以发现运行时缺陷。有大量工作使用前沿人工智能模型扫描代码，其中包括如何构建自己的 harness（测试框架）的细节。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe4c1ff216da5d89",
      "translationZh": "对于本文博客中描述的项目，我们采用了动态方法：让大语言模型（LLM）表现得像黑客一样，以评估 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）是否正常工作。该 LLM 看不到源代码，无法查看 WAF 的规则，只能获取选定的 HTTP 响应数据。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc9677033a7a1207",
      "translationZh": "我们构建了一个 WAF 测试工具，它从已知漏洞开始，然后通过改变编码方式或传递方式进行迭代，重新发送请求，并利用响应来选择下一种变体。未被拦截的请求会成为人工审查的线索，而不是已确认的漏洞。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e8546bd7da177bf",
      "translationZh": "我们在一个授权的客户预发布环境中针对六类攻击运行了测试工具，共记录了1,107次尝试。审查未被拦截的请求并剔除格式错误、良性、重复以及超出范围的观测后，绝大多数攻击被 Cloudflare WAF 拦截。少数成功通过的请求帮助我们创建了新的检测规则，以强化安全并惠及所有 Cloudflare 客户。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f1b413037b5d3b0",
      "translationZh": "在这里我们将解释我们是如何搭建系统的、测试了哪些类型的攻击、哪些攻击向量更容易绕过WAF，以及我们是如何修复的。最重要的是，我们分享了从这一过程得到的经验教训，以及这项工作如何成为我们 WAF 开发生命周期的基础构件。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "818bc43c5cc68203",
      "translationZh": "最后，我们提供指导，帮助您正确地在应用程序前部署 WAF，且最重要的是，及时修补您的软件。即使有能够绕过 WAF 的负载，也仍然需要一个可被利用的应用程序才能成功，因此保持技术栈最新是对抗攻击者的最有力防御之一。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a94947099986c81c",
      "translationZh": "自适应循环的工作原理",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "182707bccba679c1",
      "translationZh": "为了使用前沿模型测试我们的 Web 应用防火墙（WAF），我们构建了一个能够遍历多种情景的系统。情景指的是选择一个攻击类别，将输入放置在请求的特定位置，以已被 WAF 阻止的版本作为起点，并给测试者固定次数的尝试机会，以尝试其他变体。循环会对大型语言模型（LLM）执行两次调用：第一次是提案调用，第二次是审查调用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd9049fe2098f711",
      "translationZh": "第一次调用接收起始请求、上下文、先前结果的简短历史，并建议下一个变体，然后代码构建并发送该请求。审查调用接收请求上下文、响应状态、选定的头部以及响应体。当变异不再产生有用的变体或达到硬编码的尝试上限时，循环停止。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d71fc52682946b54",
      "translationZh": "两个模型调用都不需要访问 WAF 内部信息。它们既不接收规则表达式、规则 ID、WAF 攻击评分细节，也不获取执行操作的安全层身份。我们使用 Python 实现了该系统，而不是封装现有的渗透测试工具。系统能够处理 HTTP 重放、场景编排、状态跟踪以及结果收集。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cec8c521464bb69e",
      "translationZh": "在当前实现中，模型不会直接发送请求——代码控制每一步的行为。在每次请求之前，它会将目标主机名与 allowlist 进行核对，禁用重定向，记录尝试，并强制执行尝试次数限制。每次请求之后，它会记录响应，并使用模型的审查结果来选择下一个预定义的步骤。响应文本可能会出现在后续的提示中，因此测试者将其视为不可信的输入。任何模型调用都不能部署规则或更改执行策略。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "087f78b539486cf9",
      "translationZh": "系统会为每次尝试记录结构化的证据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0d53311906f94cf0",
      "translationZh": "针对单个 WAF 配置的六种攻击类别",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05ca15b23926dda3",
      "translationZh": "主要测试针对一个受 Cloudflare WAF 保护的授权客户端暂存环境。我们使用了 allowlisted 的测试 User-Agent，以确保客户端的自动流量控制不会在请求到达 WAF 之前阻止测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b83695a00bce8ec2",
      "translationZh": "我们运行了 45 个场景。对于每个场景，我们寻找以不同方式传递相同攻击的方法：不同的编码、请求的不同部分，或以另一种方式写出相同的目标。在这些场景中，有 44 个覆盖了六种攻击类别：跨站脚本攻击（XSS）、SQL 注入（SQLi）、命令注入（CMDi）、服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）、路径遍历或本地文件包含（LFI），以及 Log4j。剩余的一个场景覆盖了日志注入，单独报告。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3988401333116f30",
      "translationZh": "测试区域的 WAF 配置如下：WAF Attack Score 阻断分数为 30 或以下，所有 Cloudflare Managed Ruleset 已启用，以及 OWASP Core Ruleset 伴随 Paranoia Level 3。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "123362ff00fffdc0",
      "translationZh": "就头部测量而言，我们记录了 WAF 是否阻止了每个请求。结果描述了配置好的 WAF 边界的整体情况，而非任何单个规则或检测机制的性能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2da27a2f09964e64",
      "translationZh": "在一次记录的会话中，适应表现是什么样子",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81b0c5fa6cce37dc",
      "translationZh": "以下是LLM在测试过程中如何适应服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）攻击的一个示例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "410127a756f5d5ef",
      "translationZh": "云元数据服务可能将临时凭证暴露给工作负载。SSRF 漏洞可能使应用代表攻击者获取这些数据。WAF 可以在请求到达应用之前帮助阻止恶意请求，但这只是防护的一个层面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f511a5b85c186f12",
      "translationZh": "在此 SSRF 场景中，测试者以不同形式（如同一 IP 的整数、八进制和尾点表示）发送了相同的云元数据地址，并将其放置在请求的不同部分。WAF 阻止了所有这些请求，只有一个未被阻止。在第 18 次尝试时，模型保持了与之前被阻止尝试相同的请求结构，并切换到了尾点形式。客户端遇到了重定向，而不是 WAF 阻止。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "642d645f8987edc1",
      "translationZh": "下表显示了会话中的选定时刻。假设列总结了模型在每次操作前所说的它正在尝试的内容。这不是逐字记录，也不能证明解释是正确的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7c7ab3a4433e239",
      "translationZh": "第 17 次和第 18 次尝试构成一对有趣的案例：请求结构相同，但主机表示不同。一个被阻止，一个未被阻止。这促使我们提出一个具体问题：尾点是否会改变 WAF 读取目标的方式？这是一个值得调查的线索，但并不能证明已经访问了元数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d43ebc3d7f90355",
      "translationZh": "这是 45 种场景中选定的轨迹之一。下一节展示了我们如何对完整运行进行计数和分类。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d99efd2027f9fdc",
      "translationZh": "我们的测试者生成了 1,107 次尝试，总体结果强劲，XSS、LFI、SQLi 和 Log4j 几乎实现了全覆盖。虽然此次运行产生了有用的发现，但也产生了噪声。在人工审查后，我们剩下 49 项值得调查的发现，其中 48 项属于 CMDi 和 SSRF。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e3f8a0c9b9588da",
      "translationZh": "以下是它们的细分：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ec1d950224ec205",
      "translationZh": "记录的突变尝试",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7314edf75525b9a3",
      "translationZh": "在45个活跃场景中的模型迭代；并非所有迭代都产生了可用结果",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03cd851c414a3181",
      "translationZh": "558个被拦截的请求加上49个已记录的与WAF相关的发现",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43d15e72aa8eeaad",
      "translationZh": "WAF在请求到达应用之前将其拦截",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b718ffe5dff43a2",
      "translationZh": "在人工审查后，记录用于修复分析",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "051ebb64cf3affcd",
      "translationZh": "其余的未产生值得计数的结果，因为模型未能生成可用的HTTP请求，有些在到达目标前失败，或者生成的有效载荷是良性的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93462b7e259b1123",
      "translationZh": "当请求未被拦截时，在将其计为发现之前，我们会经过五个问题的检查：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1184073580ee008",
      "translationZh": "测试者是否实际发送了一个有效的请求？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b5d1d5c2329dd46",
      "translationZh": "如果模型失败或请求从未到达目标，结果则不会告诉我们关于 WAF 的任何信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1883634a7f051f04",
      "translationZh": "请求是否明显未被阻止？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d97f271aa306cd4",
      "translationZh": "模糊的响应不足以计数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fa316034fd5831a",
      "translationZh": "请求仍然是恶意的吗？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6880388381cb1fb2",
      "translationZh": "将请求修改以绕过 WAF 也可能使其变得无害。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "616f754cc3d85243",
      "translationZh": "行为是否属于 WAF？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36b21c4a09af7f6d",
      "translationZh": "某些攻击仅能通过 DNS 或 WAF 在请求时无法阻止的网络路径进行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc27754b02966fdd",
      "translationZh": "工程师能否安全地重现它？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41ec1d459bd35a3d",
      "translationZh": "修复需要一个具有明确预期结果的稳定测试用例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f6acabd3b031c08",
      "translationZh": "我们删除了未通过这些检查的内容，并合并了重复的案例。剩下的内容成为规则、标准化和缓解工作的输入。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "72756a9e33aeb8a7",
      "translationZh": "发现转化为检测",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48f81fa7ba5bbc75",
      "translationZh": "并非每个发现都需要新规则。有些指向现有 Managed Rules 覆盖的空白。有些指向 WAF 如何对请求进行标准化，或属于另一种安全控制。我们重放每个案例，并决定变更应发生的位置。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "292cedb2da54a8e2",
      "translationZh": "我们将相关发现分组为四组候选规则，验证每个发现，并在任何规则能够保护客户流量之前，在实际流量中测试这些候选规则。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0312ee813bfef99c",
      "translationZh": "在新规则或更新后的规则能够保护客户流量之前，我们会检查其对合法流量的影响，并评估误报风险。在评估新规则候选时，我们发现的一些问题包括：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79163e9a34a228cf",
      "translationZh": "缺失或检测范围过窄",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0057f66dc2e43273",
      "translationZh": "审查现有规则是否覆盖了该发现",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04e7b129ac6c8dd2",
      "translationZh": "等效输入被不同地解释",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cf1b80d070276e4",
      "translationZh": "引擎或归一化审查",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a0e0655bc3dbdeb",
      "translationZh": "误报风险过高",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33b71a615b83530b",
      "translationZh": "修订或拒绝该候选项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3af27be7516e7a2e",
      "translationZh": "此工作促成了 Cloudflare Managed Ruleset 的三项更改：在 7 月 21 日发布中新增 SSRF - Obfuscated Host 和 SSRF - Restricted Protocol 检测，并改进了现有的 SSRF - Cloud 规则。SSRF - Obfuscated Host 检测直接源自将内部地址以非标准数字形式编码的请求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44ac9aeeeddba499",
      "translationZh": "该模型仅是测试的一部分。我们使用同一模型族的两个版本运行了相同的场景。它们产生了不同的变体——但相同的潜在问题在两者中均出现。由于请求重播和证据捕获保持一致，我们可以在不将任何模型的输出视为 ground truth 的情况下进行比较。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a4272006b73fbf6",
      "translationZh": "在同一场景中进行更多尝试并不总是能发现更多内容。一些场景在 25 次尝试限制的末尾开始重复之前的想法。通过测试更多的起始请求、攻击类别和输入位置，而不是延长单一序列，我们获得了更广泛的覆盖。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c1e5b27e36f9876",
      "translationZh": "模型生成了请求。我们决定哪些请求重要。即使未被阻止的请求也需要重播和人工审查，才能成为发现、缓解措施或回归测试。没有该审查，就不会有任何发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "482b450580914cb7",
      "translationZh": "客户现在可以做的事情",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8c44255d7f60202",
      "translationZh": "WAF 只是您可以部署的检测层之一。当您部署所有可用的防护措施时，整体防御堆栈的有效性会提升。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0878926b98398439",
      "translationZh": "客户无需重现此实验。为了在应用程序前部署尽可能多的规则，我们建议先以日志模式运行托管规则，在 Security Events 中查看匹配的请求，并确认合法流量不受影响后再将规则切换为阻止。或者，客户可以联系他们的客户经理，在其区域启用攻击签名检测。此新功能简化了查看匹配流量和部署签名检测的过程。如果您已经在进行应用安全测试，请在受与生产环境相同的 Cloudflare 控制保护的暂存主机名上运行这些测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d28b64b48c94f404",
      "translationZh": "通过将自适应 AI 驱动的测试与人工 triage 和验证相结合，我们发现了固定测试可能遗漏的检测漏洞，并将这些发现转化为更强的 WAF 防护，提高了拦截率。在未来的帖子中，我们将分享使用白盒方法进行的进一步测试结果，在这种方法中，模型既知道应用程序的漏洞，也知道保护它的 WAF 规则。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
